      "title": "Introduction to Fractions",
      "teaching_summary": "A fraction shows equal parts of a whole. 1/2 means 1 part out of 2 equal parts. The bottom number (denominator) tells how many equal parts; the top (numerator) tells how many we have.",
      "worked_examples": [
        {
          "problem": "A pizza is cut into 4 equal pieces. You eat 1 piece. What fraction did you eat?",
          "solution_steps": [
            "Total equal pieces: 4 (denominator)",
            "Pieces eaten: 1 (numerator)",
            "Fraction = 1/4"
          ],
          "answer": "1/4"
        }
      ],
